<CaseStudy title="M2030 and 2degrees">
  <h2 class="type-h3">Manufacture 2030</h2>
  <p>I led the design of the Manufacture 2030 platform, evolving it from the initial concept of driving corporate sustainability. I established brand guidelines and created a component library to streamline the design process and ensure consistency.</p>
  <p>The customer journey consisted of a guided onboarding to set up their facility, personalise their energy spend, and select actions to improve energy efficiency. To monitor progress, I designed a Kanban-style central dashboard that provided a clear and concise overview of tasks and their status.</p>
  <p>I also created custom illustrations to give the platform a unique and approachable feel. This was important to ensure adoption within the facilities.</p>
  <Figure src="/images/login-tablet.png" alt="The Manufacture 2030 login screen on a tablet, with custom illustration." caption="UI design and custom illustrations created for the platform’s login page." wide />
