  <Figure src="/images/action-detail-1440-1.png" alt="The detail view for an efficiency action on the Manufacture 2030 dashboard." wide />
  <h3>2degrees</h3>
  <p>I worked on the 2degrees platform and public-facing website for the sustainable business community. Key milestones included working with major suppliers such as Asda-Walmart, GSK, and Unilever, being named in Sustainia’s Top 100, and joining the UN Global Opportunity Explorer. For each corporate partner, I created custom UI themes that aligned with their brand guidelines, ensuring consistent colour palettes and imagery.</p>
  <Figure src="/images/rbs-wireframe.png" alt="A low-fidelity wireframe for a 2degrees community homepage." caption="Low-fidelity design for an example community homepage." wide />
  <Figure src="/images/rbs-community-1440.png" alt="The finished RBS sustainable community homepage." caption="High-fidelity UI design for the RBS sustainable community homepage." wide />
</CaseStudy>
